    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9aa570af_c22c0865",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/Module.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 222,
      "author": {
        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-12T23:30:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the `StreamDescriptor`, the data FMQ is mutually exclusive with the `MMapBufferDescriptor`: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:hardware/interfaces/audio/aidl/android/hardware/audio/core/StreamDescriptor.aidl;l\u003d509;drc\u003d30301a42c76f82485c657f66bcdd0654564e5c9e. Thus, the data FMQ must not be created for MMap streams.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 222,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 222,
        "endChar": 85
      },
      "revId": "153623781a377c049dcba2413de2cf5d584a7b5a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "da1cf7f4_362c5e9c",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/Module.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 864,
      "author": {
        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-12T23:30:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The MMap buffer should be part of the `StreamContext`, this separate operation should not be needed.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 864,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 864,
        "endChar": 78
      },
      "revId": "153623781a377c049dcba2413de2cf5d584a7b5a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "550b959b_8c3bb150",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/Module.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 864,
      "author": {
        "id": 1478901
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-13T10:54:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since the `Stream` is created after `StreamContext`, do you preferred to configure MMap fd in `Module` and change `createStreamContext` to virtual function so that vendor can override them?",
      "parentUuid": "da1cf7f4_362c5e9c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 864,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 864,
        "endChar": 78
      },
      "revId": "153623781a377c049dcba2413de2cf5d584a7b5a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0c3966bf_95c001fd",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/Stream.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 150,
      "author": {
        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-12T23:30:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the case of MMap, both `observable` and `hardware` positions must be updated. They are retrieved on the client side separately, see here: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/media/libaudiohal/impl/StreamHalAidl.cpp;l\u003d335;drc\u003d40618538671cb540f485fec790be6a4e1f020d56\n\nThe `observable` position is filled using the same way both for non-MMap and MMap streams. The `hardware` position is reported by tinyALSA via `pcm_mmap_get_hw_ptr`: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/tinyalsa_new/src/pcm.c;l\u003d1601;drc\u003d6a9dc10d114a161332fb6035a9983bc51d0a9c29.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 149,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 150,
        "endChar": 70
      },
      "revId": "153623781a377c049dcba2413de2cf5d584a7b5a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5c8cbbb9_f1b13a37",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/Stream.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
