      "writtenOn": "2024-06-12T23:30:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`read` (as well as `write`) must not be called for MMap. There must be no `dataMQ` for MMap (see my previous comment), thus this code will crash. Latency should be reported by other means. For example, we may add an optional parameter to `refinePosition`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 330,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 334,
        "endChar": 94
      },
      "revId": "153623781a377c049dcba2413de2cf5d584a7b5a",
